    {
      "text": "The diff matches turboderp’s commit message: it replaces `>=` with `==` in both `requirements.txt` and `setup.py`’s `install_requires`. Changing both declarations keeps installation from the requirements file and installation through package metadata aligned on FlashAttention.",
