      "text": "No runtime import or attention dispatch changes. `exllamav3/modules/attn.py` still imports both FlashAttention functions at module load, so selecting the existing `sdpa_nc` branch does not bypass that import. The KV-quantization experiment in `science/kv_quant_exp.py` still imports and calls `flash_attn_func` directly.",
