  "source_notes": [
    {
      "text": "The initial installation chapter records that `requirements.txt` already named `2.7.4.post1` as the minimum while `setup.py` omitted FlashAttention. The later “Fix requirements” entry records adding the same minimum to `install_requires` and retaining the Torch-availability check and `EXLLAMA_NOCOMPILE` switch. The Formatron entry records later additions of `kbnf` and `formatron` to both lists.",
