    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #17, “ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'torch' when installing requirements.txt,” quotes the old requirement verbatim. The reporter describes missing Torch and a Windows wheel build that appeared to hang; a reply from `turboderp` suggests installing PyTorch first and points to a Windows wheel for `2.7.4.post1`.",
