      "evidence": ["call_f120dd881cdb4691aed2fa403a862c6a", "call_f339723c6c9f4acc8fe14c644c057a56", "call_a6ed683b2701476aa88254878d270c8c"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #2, “Error: setup script specifies an absolute path,” reports a wheel-build rejection, and PR #3 explicitly names that issue. Issue #21, “Build Failure on Windows: CUDA 12.4 / PyTorch 2.7.0+cu126 / VS 2022,” reports ExLlamaV3 extension compiler errors and was closed without a reported solution.",
