      "evidence": ["call_50a89bc143b84d77a88bb34ccb3f5d48"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issues #2 and #21 overlap with this change through `setup.py` and the installation workflow, not through the reported failures. The inspected parent already uses relative native-source paths, and the pin changes neither source-path construction nor compiler configuration.",
