      "evidence": ["call_dfe467fa1d2c45d1a65ccbc4d5395b97", "call_f96762d3f0104527af903b74c6fdd855", "call_187dc0a8f350495e94e41442d933415a", "call_a6ed683b2701476aa88254878d270c8c"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Issue #16, “RuntimeError: CUDA error: invalid configuration argument,” shows `decode_flash_attn_nc` in the conversion traceback, with the error reported during linear Hessian capture. The discussion attributes the failure to tokenizer truncation. Issue #49, “running the QTIP inference code,” discusses installing QTIP and a `fast-hadamard-transform`/Ninja blocker.",
