        {
          "text": "`requirements.txt` and `setup.py` declare the same `flash_attn==2.7.4.post1` constraint. The setup edit is confined to `install_requires`; the separate Torch check and `EXLLAMA_NOCOMPILE` logic still govern whether ExLlamaV3 configures its own native extension for precompilation.",
