          "text": "The existing no-cache decoder passes projected Q, K, and V to `flash_attn_func`. The cached decoder obtains the cache tensors, passes them with the block table and sequence lengths to `flash_attn_with_kvcache`, then calls `cache.update_layer`. The pin changes which dependency release is requested, not either call interface.",
